# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Vendored agent skill packs downloaded from GitHub. Reinstallable from
# skills-lock.json, ~6 MB, and not read by Claude Code (it only loads
# .claude/skills). Nothing in the developer-agent system depends on them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.agents/skills/

# .claude/skills/ is deliberately NOT ignored: it holds the project-local Lura
# skills that the developer agents in .claude/agents/ load, and they have to
# travel with the repository. Only settings.local.json stays machine-local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
